  "checks": [
    "The parameter-order loss is chosen once from the actual weighted endpoint estimate at arity n+1, before every angular order b and material degree c.",
    "The same localized snoc state slot and actual closed-radius angular tower are used. All other directions remain normalized in the original base seminorm.",
    "The low true energy stays at (base,c+1); the high true energy is at (b+loss+parameterLoss,c+1). The same one-high split is applied, without replacing the actual component sample.",
